       "text": "ANGLE ID: ND1-O21b\nSTATUS: Copy complete\nCORE ARGUMENT: Neighbor version of the VA story: share the partial claim option with veterans who may be behind.\nAUDIENCE: Monroe County neighbors\nTAKEAWAY: If a veteran you know is behind on a VA loan, the first call is to their servicer.\nFORMAT: Nextdoor post · Effort: Low\nSOURCES:\n• GAO-27-108908, VA Partial Claim Program (Nov 2026) — https://www.gao.gov/assets/gao-27-108908.pdf\n• VA launch announcement, June 15, 2026 (via myairforcebenefits.us.af.mil) — https://myairforcebenefits.us.af.mil/VA-launches-Partial-Claim-Program-to-help-Veterans-avoid-home-foreclosure\nBEFORE POSTING:\n• Replaces the planned PA disabled-veteran tax exemption post, which last week's Blog 2 already covered.\n• Same story as Ledger 2 in a neighborly register. No shared sentences, per standing rule. No pitch, no keyword, no hashtags."
