       "kind": "text",
       "text": "Passing this along for any veteran neighbors, or anyone with a veteran in the family.\n\nIf you have a VA home loan and you've fallen behind on payments, the VA has a newer program called a partial claim. In short: after a three-month trial payment plan, the missed amount can be paid off for you and moved into a separate lien that gets repaid when the home is sold, refinanced or paid off.\n\nMortgage companies have until November 28 to have it fully up and running, so some may not have offered it yet.\n\nThe first step is calling the company you send your mortgage payment to and asking to be reviewed for VA home retention options, including the partial claim.\n\n— Alexa Sanchez, East Stroudsburg"
