       "kind": "text",
       "text": "ANGLE ID: GBP2-O33\nSTATUS: Copy complete\nCORE ARGUMENT: Explains the preliminary pricing review honestly for search: what goes into it and how it differs from an appraisal.\nAUDIENCE: Homeowners searching 'what is my home worth Monroe County'\nTAKEAWAY: A pricing review is a Realtor's market opinion from sold, active and expired listings; an appraisal is a licensed appraiser's valuation, usually for a lender.\nFORMAT: GBP post · Effort: Low\nSOURCES:\n• Evergreen. Brand rule: preliminary pricing opinion is never called an appraisal."
