       "label": "Publish-ready post",
       "kind": "text",
       "text": "What's my home worth in Monroe County? Here's what a free pricing review from me includes, and what it isn't.\n\nIt includes:\n• Recent sales of similar homes near you\n• The homes you'd compete against if you listed today\n• Listings that didn't sell, and at what price\n• Your home's condition, updates and location\n\nIt isn't an appraisal. An appraisal is done by a licensed appraiser, usually for a lender. A pricing review is my professional opinion of where your home would sell in today's market, to help you decide whether and when to list.\n\nThere's no cost and no obligation. Tap Call to set one up for your home in Stroudsburg, East Stroudsburg, Tannersville or anywhere in Monroe County.\n\nAlexa Sanchez · PA License No. RS326383 · Smart Way America Realty · 528 Seven Bridges Rd, Suite 108, East Stroudsburg, PA 18301"
