       "text": "ANGLE ID: FB5-O15\nSTATUS: Copy complete\nCORE ARGUMENT: Monthly Monroe numbers swing enough that pricing off a single month misleads; use year-to-date and current competition.\nAUDIENCE: Homeowners reading market headlines\nTAKEAWAY: One month is noise. Year-to-date plus your actual competition is the signal.\nFORMAT: Text post + mini table graphic · Effort: Low\nSOURCES:\n• PMAR Monthly Indicators, October 2026 (Monroe County, all residential; ShowingTime, current as of Nov 9, 2026)\nBEFORE POSTING:\n• April 2026 median $370,000; Sept $336,125; Oct $350,000; YTD $339,000. % of original price: Sept 93.3%, Oct 95.2%."
