       "text": "ANGLE ID: TH4-O29\nSTATUS: Copy complete\nCORE ARGUMENT: A price cut lowers the payment; a closing-cost credit lowers cash to close. Payment-stretched buyers feel them differently.\nAUDIENCE: Sellers weighing how to negotiate\nTAKEAWAY: Ask what the buyer is short on, monthly payment or cash, before deciding between a cut and a credit.\nFORMAT: Single post · Effort: Low\nSOURCES:\n• Evergreen. Affordability index 101 (PMAR Oct 2026) as context only.\nBEFORE POSTING:\n• Lender rules limit seller credits by loan type; don't state limits in the post."
