       "text": "Sellers ask me all the time: is it better to drop the price or offer a closing-cost credit?\n\nDepends what the buyer is short on. A price cut lowers their monthly payment a little. A credit lowers the cash they need at closing, sometimes a lot.\n\nA buyer who's stretched on cash cares about the credit. One stretched on payment cares about the price. Ask which before you decide."
